he blue tsunami that just swept through America.</span></p><p style=3D"font=
:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Texas =E2=
=80=94 where Elon Musk spent hundreds of millions of dollars supporting the=
