hree decades =E2=80=94 elected both a Democratic senator and a Democratic g=
overnor. Kansas now has its first Democratic senator since the Great Depres=
sion.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;=
margin:0 0 15px"><span>It will most likely take a few weeks to process the =
fallout. But at this point, the results are so stunning that many are seein=
g in this election not just a reckoning for Republicans, but a seismic shif=
t in American politics: the beginning of the end of the Trump era.</span></=
